# Architecture

- Orders follow FSM: Draft → AwaitingPayment → Paid → Provisioned → Active → Expired | Revoked.
- Deliver a proxy link only after `Paid`. Never invent IPs, ports, or secrets (no seeded/random “fake fleet”).
- Catalog slots are real: admin-pasted `t.me/proxy` links or later telemt-managed users.
- Prefer vertical slices: catalog → payment → provision → renew. Keep mtproto secret parsing in `packages/mtproto` (or `apps/bot/mtproto`).
- For channel-sponsor (ad_tag): use telemt or official MTProxy — not mtg v2 (ad_tag removed).
- Prefer Crypto Pay + admin manual credit for v1; Stars later.
